    "description": "Omarchy Store is the desktop app for omarchystore.com. It turns the store into a real app store on your Omarchy computer: press GET and the app installs, no terminal needed.\n\nONE-CLICK APPS\n\u2022 GET installs any of the 850+ apps in the store with your computer's own package manager (Arch Linux, the AUR or Omarchy's installer). You confirm with your own password.\n\u2022 OPEN starts an app you already have, UPDATE appears when a newer version is out, and Remove uninstalls it.\n\u2022 The store sees which apps are already on your computer and shows them in Installed.\n\nUPDATES IN ONE PLACE\n\u2022 The Updates tab lists every app with a newer version, from Arch, the AUR and the store's own apps, with Update All for everything.\n\u2022 When a newer Omarchy Store is out, an Update button appears in the bottom right corner. One click and the store updates itself in a few seconds.\n\nTHEMES, PLUGINS AND SCREENSAVERS\n\u2022 Hundreds of Omarchy themes with previews: install and switch with one click, remove the ones you don't use.\n\u2022 Thousands of plugins and screensavers, installed with one click where they support it, with a link to the source for the rest.\n\nIGNITE: MAKE AN OMARCHY USB\n\u2022 Plug in a USB stick and press Make Installer. The store downloads the newest official Omarchy, checks it's genuine (SHA-256) and writes the stick for you.\n\nLOOKS THE WAY YOU LIKE\n\u2022 Matches your Omarchy theme, with Dark, Glass (frosted, see-through) and White looks at the bottom of the sidebar.\n\u2022 Ratings and reviews on every app.\n\nSAFE BY DESIGN\n\u2022 Installs to your home folder only. Remove it any time with omarchy-store --uninstall.\n\u2022 It never runs code from a web page. It only asks your package manager to install things, and checks the fingerprint of every direct download.\n\u2022 Apps in the store are third-party software, provided as-is: install at your own risk (see the Disclaimer page).\n\nHOW TO GET IT\nOpen a terminal 